Scope note: this license covers the code in this repository (the `sam`
CLI in packages/cli and the catalog site in apps/web).

The skills themselves — the SKILL.md files under packages/cli/skills —
each declare their own license in their YAML frontmatter, which governs
that file. Where a skill declares a license, that declaration takes
precedence over this file for that skill's content.

Third-party components retain their original licenses, including the
React Bits components under apps/web/src/components.
